      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**PostgreSQL dashboard** — requires `postgres_exporter` scraping your DB (metric names here are the standard `pg_stat_*` defaults). Panels show \"No data\" until it's running. Quick setup:\n\n```\n# docker-compose-observability.yml\npostgres-exporter:\n  image: prometheuscommunity/postgres-exporter:latest\n  environment:\n    DATA_SOURCE_NAME: \"postgresql://USER:PASS@host.docker.internal:5432/DB?sslmode=disable\"\n  ports:\n    - \"9187:9187\"\n```\n\nThen add to `prometheus.yml`:\n\n```\n- job_name: postgres\n  static_configs:\n    - targets: [\"host.docker.internal:9187\"]\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
